D.add_heading('Research Integrity and Evidence Status',1)
para(D,'This work is explicitly a literature-parameterized mathematical and computational proof-of-concept. No patient-level registry, prospective cohort, clinical trial dataset, raw echocardiographic video, laboratory experiment, or clinical device stream was analyzed. Published guidelines and clinical studies were used to define clinically recognizable variables, imaging roles, and numerical anchors such as coaptation length, coaptation depth, leaflet length, residual 3D vena-contracta area (VCA), and transmitral gradient; they were not used to fabricate patient records or to infer unreported measurement-error distributions. Prior covariance matrices, view-specific observation noise, acquisition penalties, utility weights, phase-transition rules, and stopping tolerances are therefore labeled provisional structural assumptions. Every numerical result below is generated by the accompanying code and is interpreted only as internal behavior of the proposed framework. It is not a clinical effect estimate, validated diagnostic threshold, sensitivity/specificity result, or recommendation to acquire or omit a particular view in an actual procedure. Final effect estimates must be recalculated from the underlying registry or longitudinal imaging data before scientific or clinical interpretation.')

