steps=[
'1. Audit literature anchors and classify each value as literature-derived, contextual, or provisional.',
'2. Define the latent M-TEER state [coaptation gap, coaptation length, residual 3D-VCA, transmitral gradient].',
'3. Specify candidate view observation matrices and provisional measurement-noise covariance matrices.',
'4. Verify positive-semidefinite prior/process/observation covariance matrices and dimensional consistency.',
'5. Run the reference belief-state sequence and record entropy and posterior SD after every acquisition.',
'6. Calculate phase-specific view utilities and the reference stopping condition.',
'7. Simulate 600 synthetic truth scenarios solely for structural stress testing.',
'8. Compare five policies and retain their acquisition burden and terminal uncertainty outputs.',
'9. Generate 1,200 model decision states and perform internal softmax action recovery using AIC/BIC.',
'10. Iterate covariance maps to stationary states and calculate Jacobian spectral radii for complementary imaging cycles.',
'11. Draw 500 Latin-hypercube parameter sets and calculate PRCC for terminal entropy and acquisition burden.',
'12. Perform local elasticity and eight prespecified structural scenarios.',
'13. Generate the coaptation-gap × residual-VCA first-view sensitivity surface.',
'14. Rebuild all figures, table figures, CSVs, and the manuscript from the same random seed.',
'15. Replace provisional noise, phase, cost, and stopping parameters with estimates from longitudinal intraprocedural datasets before clinical interpretation.'
]
